{
  "name": "sort",
  "description": "Sorting algorithms for arrays. Provides in-place sorting (ascending and descending) for integer and string arrays, plus binary search, min/max, reverse, and sorted-check utilities. Arrays are represented as pointers to contiguous 8-byte values.",
